    "$note_not_product_renders": "hero-ob.mp4, hero-v2.mp4 and hero-bg.mp4 were REMOVED from this manifest on 2026-09-05. Inspecting their frames showed they are cinematic stock/AI footage (a woman walking a sunlit corridor; a Tuscan landscape through an arch; a cypress avenue to a villa) — they contain no product geometry, so a 3D overhaul cannot make them stale. They were originally ranked top priority purely on file date and exposure, which was wrong. Leave them alone; replacing them with 3D renders would be a creative decision, not a staleness fix."
